meta {
  name: List Manufacturers
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/manufacturers
  body: none
  auth: none
}

docs {
  # List Manufacturers (HU29 - Consultar Fabricantes)

  Lista todos los fabricantes del sistema.
  Este endpoint NO requiere autenticación (público).

  ## Respuesta exitosa (200)
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "code": "FAB_LIST_EXI_03104",
    "data": {
      "manufacturers": [
        {
          "id": "encoded_manufacturer_id",
          "name": "Boeing"
        },
        {
          "id": "encoded_manufacturer_id",
          "name": "Airbus"
        }
      ],
      "_links": [...]
    }
  }
  ```

  ## Errores
  - 500: Error interno del servidor (FAB_LIST_ERR_03105)
}
